        .dialog-backdrop {
            display: none;
            position: fixed;
            inset: 0;
            background: rgba(10,20,35,.62);
            z-index: 1000;
            padding: 20px;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            backdrop-filter: blur(2px)
        }

            .dialog-backdrop.open {
                display: flex
            }

        .dialog {
            width: min(850px,100%);
            max-height: calc(100vh - 35px);
            background: #fff;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 22px 65px rgba(0,0,0,.30);
            overflow: hidden;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column
        }

        .dialog-head {
            padding: 13px 15px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            background: #fbfcfe
        }

            .dialog-head h3 {
                margin: 0;
                color: var(--navy);
                font-size: 17px
            }

            .dialog-head small {
                display: block;
                color: var(--muted);
                margin-top: 2px
            }

        .dialog-body {
            padding: 14px;
            overflow: auto
        }

        .dialog-foot {
            padding: 11px 14px;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
            display: flex;
            justify-content: flex-end;
            gap: 7px;
            background: #fbfcfe
        }

        .x {
            border: 0;
            background: none;
            font-size: 21px;
            cursor: pointer;
            color: #69778a
        }

        .planner-top {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4,1fr);
            gap: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 11px
        }

        .planner-kpi {
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 8px 9px;
            background: #f8fafc
        }

            .planner-kpi span {
                display: block;
                font-size: 8px;
                text-transform: uppercase;
                color: var(--muted);
                font-weight: 800
            }

            .planner-kpi strong {
                display: block;
                margin-top: 2px;
                font-size: 17px;
                color: var(--navy)
            }

            .planner-kpi.remaining {
                background: var(--warnBg);
                border-color: #e6cc87
            }

                .planner-kpi.remaining strong {
                    color: var(--warn2)
                }

            .planner-kpi.complete {
                background: var(--okBg);
                border-color: #a9dec3
            }

                .planner-kpi.complete strong {
                    color: var(--ok)
                }

        .live-location {
            border: 1px solid #cdd9e8;
            border-radius: 9px;
            background: #f5f9ff;
            margin-bottom: 11px;
            overflow: hidden
        }

        .live-location-head {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 7px 9px;
            background: #edf4ff;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #dbe5f0
        }

            .live-location-head strong {
                font-size: 10px;
                color: var(--navy)
            }

        .live-location-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1.4fr repeat(3,1fr)
        }

            .live-location-grid > div {
                padding: 8px 10px;
                border-right: 1px solid #dbe5f0
            }

                .live-location-grid > div:last-child {
                    border-right: 0
                }

            .live-location-grid span {
                display: block;
                font-size: 7px;
                text-transform: uppercase;
                color: #7b899a;
                font-weight: 800
            }

            .live-location-grid strong {
                display: block;
                margin-top: 2px;
                font-size: 12px;
                color: var(--navy)
            }

        .live-location-foot {
            padding: 6px 9px;
            border-top: 1px solid #dbe5f0;
            font-size: 9px;
            color: var(--muted)
        }

        #liveActualizado {
            float: right
        }

        .planner-message {
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 9px 10px;
            font-size: 11px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            border: 1px solid
        }

            .planner-message.info {
                background: var(--blueSoft);
                border-color: #c3d5f1;
                color: #254c85
            }

            .planner-message.warning {
                background: var(--warnBg);
                border-color: #e7ca7e;
                color: #715000
            }

            .planner-message.error {
                background: var(--dangerBg);
                border-color: #efb4ae;
                color: #8b1e17
            }

        .planner-actions {
            display: flex;
            gap: 6px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            margin-bottom: 10px
        }

        .planner-help {
            padding: 8px 10px;
            border: 1px solid #cbd9eb;
            background: #f5f8fc;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-size: 10px;
            color: #52657e
        }

            .planner-help strong {
                color: var(--navy)
            }

        .planner-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            border: 1px solid var(--line)
        }

            .planner-table th {
                background: #eaf0f6;
                color: #52647b;
                font-size: 8px;
                text-transform: uppercase;
                text-align: left;
                padding: 6px
            }

            .planner-table td {
                padding: 6px;
                border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
                vertical-align: top
            }

            .planner-table input {
                width: 100%;
                border: 1px solid var(--line2);
                border-radius: 6px;
                padding: 7px;
                outline: none
            }

                .planner-table input:focus {
                    border-color: #668ac0;
                    box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(35,63,128,.07)
                }

                .planner-table input[readonly] {
                    background: #edf3fa;
                    color: var(--navy);
                    font-weight: 900;
                    cursor: not-allowed;
                    border-color: #c9d7e8
                }

            .planner-table .col-date {
                width: 160px
            }

            .planner-table .col-qty {
                width: 135px
            }

            .planner-table .col-delete {
                width: 42px
            }

        .saldo-tag {
            display: block;
            margin-top: 3px;
            font-size: 7px;
            color: var(--blue);
            font-weight: 800
        }

        .row-warning {
            display: none;
            color: var(--warn);
            font-size: 8px;
            margin-top: 3px
        }

            .row-warning.show {
                display: block
            }

        .rest-bar {
            margin-top: 11px;
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 9px;
            background: #f8fafc
        }

        .rest-head {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            font-size: 10px;
            color: var(--muted);
            margin-bottom: 5px
        }

            .rest-head strong {
                color: var(--navy)
            }

        .rest-track {
            height: 9px;
            background: #e2e9f1;
            border-radius: 999px;
            overflow: hidden
        }

            .rest-track span {
                display: block;
                height: 100%;
                background: var(--blue2);
                transition: width .15s
            }

            .rest-track.complete span {
                background: var(--ok2)
            }

            .rest-track.error span {
                background: var(--danger2)
            }

        @@media(max-width:1200px) {
            .summary {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(4,1fr)
            }

            .client-head-inner {
                grid-template-columns: minmax(200px,1.5fr) repeat(3,minmax(85px,.6fr)) 32px
            }

            .client-kpi.hide-medium {
                display: none
            }
        }

        @@media(max-width:750px) {
            .page {
                padding: 9px
            }

            .header {
                align-items: flex-start;
                flex-direction: column
            }

            .summary {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2,1fr)
            }

            .search-box {
                width: 100%;
                min-width: 100%
            }

            .client-head-inner {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr 90px 30px
            }

            .client-kpi {
                display: none
            }

                .client-kpi.mobile-show {
                    display: block
                }

            .planner-top {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2,1fr)
            }

            .live-location-grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2,1fr)
            }
        }

        .print-sheet {
            display: none
        }

        @@media print {
            @@page {
                size: A4 landscape;
                margin: 10mm
            }

            html, body {
                margin: 0 !important;
                padding: 0 !important;
                background: #fff !important;
                color: #111 !important;
                font-family: Arial, sans-serif !important
            }

                body > * {
                    display: none !important
                }

            #programacionPrint {
                display: block !important;
                width: 100% !important;
                position: static !important;
                background: #fff !important;
                color: #111 !important
            }

            .print-head {
                display: flex;
                justify-content: space-between;
                align-items: flex-end;
                gap: 18px;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #173a7a;
                padding-bottom: 8px;
                margin-bottom: 12px
            }

                .print-head h1 {
                    margin: 0;
                    font-size: 20px;
                    color: #101b31
                }

                .print-head p {
                    margin: 3px 0 0;
                    font-size: 10px;
                    color: #4d5b6d
                }

            .print-week {
                text-align: right;
                white-space: nowrap
            }

                .print-week strong {
                    display: block;
                    font-size: 14px;
                    color: #173a7a
                }

                .print-week span {
                    display: block;
                    margin-top: 2px;
                    font-size: 10px;
                    color: #4d5b6d
                }

            .print-table {
                width: 100%;
                border-collapse: collapse;
                table-layout: fixed;
                font-size: 9px
            }

                .print-table th {
                    background: #e9eff6 !important;
                    color: #26374e !important;
                    border: 1px solid #aebdce;
                    padding: 6px 5px;
                    text-align: left;
                    font-size: 8px;
                    text-transform: uppercase;
                    -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact;
                    print-color-adjust: exact
                }

                .print-table td {
                    border: 1px solid #c6d0dc;
                    padding: 6px 5px;
                    vertical-align: top;
                    line-height: 1.25
                }

                .print-table tr {
                    break-inside: avoid;
                    page-break-inside: avoid
                }

                .print-table .print-date {
                    width: 90px;
                    white-space: nowrap;
                    font-weight: 700
                }

                .print-table .print-client {
                    width: 150px;
                    font-weight: 700
                }

                .print-table .print-ref {
                    width: 125px;
                    font-family: Consolas, monospace;
                    font-weight: 700
                }

                .print-table .print-qty {
                    width: 82px;
                    text-align: right;
                    white-space: nowrap;
                    font-weight: 700
                }

                .print-table .print-status {
                    width: 105px;
                    font-weight: 700
                }

                .print-table .print-obs {
                    width: 180px
                }

            .print-day-row td {
                background: #f5f7fa !important;
                color: #173a7a !important;
                font-weight: 800;
                border-top: 2px solid #9eb1c8;
                -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact;
                print-color-adjust: exact
            }

            .print-empty {
                border: 1px solid #c6d0dc;
                padding: 24px;
                text-align: center;
                color: #5f6c7b;
                font-size: 11px
            }
        }

        /* ===== Ajuste final del modal de programación ===== */
        .dialog-backdrop {
            padding: 12px;
            overflow: hidden
        }

        .dialog {
            width: min(980px,100%);
            max-height: calc(100dvh - 24px);
            min-height: 0
        }

        #formProgramacion {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            width: 100%;
            min-height: 0;
            max-height: calc(100dvh - 24px)
        }

        .dialog-head, .dialog-foot {
            flex: 0 0 auto
        }

        .dialog-head {
            align-items: flex-start;
            gap: 12px
        }

        .dialog-body {
            flex: 1 1 auto;
            min-height: 0;
            overflow-y: auto;
            overscroll-behavior: contain;
            padding-bottom: 18px
        }

        .dialog-foot {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 3;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            box-shadow: 0 -5px 18px rgba(16,27,49,.06)
        }

        .dialog-foot-actions {
            display: flex;
            gap: 7px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            justify-content: flex-end
        }

        .dialog-foot-summary {
            min-width: 0;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 10px;
            line-height: 1.35
        }

            .dialog-foot-summary strong {
                color: var(--navy)
            }

        .planner-top {
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))
        }

        .planner-kpi.before {
            background: #f3f7fc;
            border-color: #cbd8e7
        }

        .planner-kpi.after {
            background: var(--blueSoft);
            border-color: #bfd2ee
        }

        .planner-kpi.protected {
            background: #f5f2ff;
            border-color: #d9cff7
        }

            .planner-kpi.protected strong {
                color: var(--purple)
            }

        .planner-context {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 8px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            margin: -2px 0 10px;
            padding: 7px 9px;
            border: 1px solid #d8e1ec;
            border-radius: 8px;
            background: #fbfcfe;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 10px
        }

            .planner-context strong {
                color: var(--navy)
            }

        .planner-list {
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
            border-radius: 9px;
            overflow: hidden;
            background: #fff
        }

        .planner-list-head, .planner-row {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 160px 150px minmax(220px,1fr) 44px;
            gap: 8px;
            align-items: start
        }

        .planner-list-head {
            padding: 7px 9px;
            background: #eaf0f6;
            color: #52647b;
            font-size: 8px;
            font-weight: 800;
            text-transform: uppercase
        }

        .planner-row {
            padding: 9px;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
            transition: .12s
        }

            .planner-row:first-child {
                border-top: 0
            }

            .planner-row.existing {
                background: #fbfdff
            }

            .planner-row.new-row {
                background: #fffdf7
            }

            .planner-row.changed {
                box-shadow: inset 3px 0 0 #d99a14
            }

            .planner-row.duplicate {
                background: #fff4f2;
                box-shadow: inset 3px 0 0 var(--danger2)
            }

        .planner-field label {
            display: none;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 8px;
            font-weight: 800;
            text-transform: uppercase
        }

        .planner-field input {
            width: 100%;
            min-height: 38px;
            border: 1px solid var(--line2);
            border-radius: 7px;
            padding: 7px 9px;
            outline: none;
            background: #fff
        }

            .planner-field input:focus {
                border-color: #668ac0;
                box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(35,63,128,.07)
            }

        .planner-row-tag {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 4px;
            margin-top: 4px;
            padding: 2px 6px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: #edf3fa;
            color: var(--blue);
            font-size: 7px;
            font-weight: 800
        }

        .planner-row.new-row .planner-row-tag {
            background: var(--warnBg);
            color: var(--warn)
        }

        .planner-row-note {
            display: block;
            margin-top: 3px;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 7px;
            line-height: 1.25
        }

            .planner-row-note.warn {
                color: var(--warn)
            }

            .planner-row-note.error {
                color: var(--danger);
                font-weight: 800
            }

        .planner-delete {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: flex-end;
            padding-top: 1px
        }

            .planner-delete .btn {
                width: 34px;
                min-width: 34px;
                padding-left: 0;
                padding-right: 0
            }

        .planner-empty {
            padding: 15px;
            color: var(--muted);
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 10px
        }

        .planner-message strong {
            color: inherit
        }

        .rest-head {
            gap: 10px
        }

        .rest-detail {
            display: block;
            margin-top: 4px;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 9px
        }

        @@media(max-width:850px) {
            .dialog-backdrop {
                padding: 6px
            }

            .dialog {
                width: 100%;
                max-height: calc(100dvh - 12px)
            }

            .planner-top {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))
            }

            .live-location-grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))
            }

                .live-location-grid > div:nth-child(2) {
                    border-right: 0
                }

                .live-location-grid > div:nth-child(-n+2) {
                    border-bottom: 1px solid #dbe5f0
                }

            .planner-list-head {
                display: none
            }

            .planner-row {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));
                gap: 8px 10px;
                padding: 11px
            }

            .planner-field.obs {
                grid-column: 1 / -1
            }

            .planner-field label {
                display: block
            }

            .planner-delete {
                grid-column: 1 / -1;
                justify-content: flex-end;
                padding-top: 0
            }

                .planner-delete .btn {
                    width: auto;
                    min-width: 92px
                }
        }

        @@media(max-width:560px) {
            .dialog-backdrop {
                padding: 0;
                align-items: stretch
            }

            .dialog {
                width: 100%;
                height: 100dvh;
                max-height: 100dvh;
                border-radius: 0
            }

            #formProgramacion {
                height: 100%;
                max-height: 100dvh
            }

            .dialog-head {
                padding: 11px 12px
            }

                .dialog-head h3 {
                    font-size: 15px
                }

            .dialog-body {
                padding: 10px
            }

            .planner-top {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));
                gap: 6px
            }

            .planner-kpi {
                padding: 7px
            }

                .planner-kpi strong {
                    font-size: 15px
                }

            .live-location-head {
                align-items: center;
                gap: 6px
            }

            .live-location-grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))
            }

            #liveActualizado {
                float: none;
                display: block;
                margin-top: 3px
            }

            .planner-actions {
                display: grid;
                grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr
            }

                .planner-actions .btn {
                    width: 100%;
                    white-space: normal
                }

            .planner-row {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr
            }

            .planner-field.obs, .planner-delete {
                grid-column: auto
            }

                .planner-delete .btn {
                    width: 100%
                }

            .dialog-foot {
                display: block;
                padding: 9px 10px
            }

            .dialog-foot-summary {
                margin-bottom: 7px;
                text-align: center
            }

            .dialog-foot-actions {
                display: grid;
                grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
                width: 100%
            }

                .dialog-foot-actions .btn {
                    width: 100%;
                    min-height: 40px
                }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="page">
        <div class="header">
            <div class="header-left">
                <a class="back-main" asp-controller="LogisticaOperacion" asp-action="Index">
                    <span class="back-icon">←</span>
                    <span>
                        <small>REGRESAR A</small>
                        <strong>Centro Operativo</strong>
                    </span>
                </a>

                <div class="header-title">
                    <h1>Lista de carga semanal</h1>
                    <p>Consulta la demanda y programa el día de carga por cliente y parte. Los embarques continúan desde el Centro Operativo.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="header-actions">
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-soft" id="btnImprimirProgramacion" title="Imprimir la programación de la semana mostrada">
                    🖨 Imprimir programación
                </button>

                <a class="btn btn-soft"
                   asp-controller="LogisticaListaCarga"
                   asp-action="DiasCargaClientes"
                   title="Configurar días habituales de carga por cliente">
                    Días habituales
                </a>

                <a class="btn"
                   asp-controller="LogisticaListaCarga"
                   asp-action="Index"
                   asp-route-anio="@anioAnterior"
                   asp-route-semana="@numeroSemanaAnterior">
                    ‹ Anterior
                </a>

                <div class="week-box">
                    <strong>@Model.SemanaTexto</strong>
                    <span>@Model.RangoTexto</span>
                </div>

                <a class="btn"
                   asp-controller="LogisticaListaCarga"
                   asp-action="Index"
                   asp-route-anio="@anioSiguiente"
                   asp-route-semana="@numeroSemanaSiguiente">
                    Siguiente ›
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>

        @if (TempData["LogisticaOk"] is string ok && !string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(ok))
        {
            <div class="notice notice-ok">@ok</div>
        }

        @if (TempData["LogisticaError"] is string error && !string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(error))
        {
            <div class="notice notice-error">@error</div>
        }

        <div class="summary">
            <div class="summary-item">
                <span>Clientes</span>
                <strong>@Model.TotalClientes</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="summary-item">
                <span>Partes</span>
                <strong>@Model.TotalPartidas</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="summary-item">
                <span>Demanda semana</span>
                <strong>@Model.TotalSemana.ToString("N0")</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="summary-item danger">
                <span>Expeditado</span>
                <strong>@Model.TotalAtraso.ToString("N0")</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="summary-item">
                <span>Por atender</span>
                <strong>@Model.TotalPorAtender.ToString("N0")</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="summary-item warning">
                <span>Sin programar</span>
                <strong>@Model.TotalSinProgramar.ToString("N0")</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="summary-item">
                <span>Programado</span>
                <strong>@Model.TotalProgramado.ToString("N0")</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="summary-item success">
                <span>Enviado</span>
                <strong>@Model.TotalEnviado.ToString("N0")</strong>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="toolbar">
            <div class="search-box">
                <span class="search-icon">⌕</span>
                <input id="buscarClienteParte" placeholder="Buscar cliente, referencia o designación..." autocomplete="off" />
            </div>

            <span class="toolbar-label">Mostrar</span>

            <select id="filtroEstado">
                <option value="todos">Todos los clientes</option>
                <option value="expeditado">Con expeditados</option>
                <option value="pendiente">Con piezas sin programar</option>
                <option value="programado">Con programación</option>
            </select>

            <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm" id="btnExpandir">Expandir todos</button>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm" id="btnContraer">Contraer todos</button>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <div class="section-head">
                <div>
                    <h2>Programación por cliente · @Model.SemanaTexto</h2>
                    <small>Define el día de carga por cliente y parte. La creación del embarque continúa desde el Centro Operativo.</small>
                </div>

            </div>

            <div class="clients">
                @foreach (var grupo in gruposClientes)
                {
                    var totalSemana = grupo.Sum(x => x.TotalSemana);
                    var totalAtraso = grupo.Sum(x => x.Atraso);
                    var totalAtender = grupo.Sum(x => x.TotalPorAtender);
                    var totalProgramado = grupo.Sum(x => x.TotalProgramado);
                    var totalPendiente = grupo.Sum(x => x.TotalSinProgramar);
                    var totalEnviado = grupo.Sum(x => x.TotalEnviado);

                    var dias = grupo
                    .SelectMany(x => x.DiasHabituales)
                    .GroupBy(x => x.DiaSemana)
                    .Select(x => x.First())
                    .OrderBy(x => x.DiaSemana)
                    .ToList();

                    var diasTexto = dias.Count == 0
                    ? "Sin día habitual"
                    : string.Join(" · ", dias.Select(x => x.DiaTexto));

                    var search = (grupo.Key.Cliente + " " + string.Join(" ", grupo.Select(x => x.Referencia + " " + x.Designacion))).ToLowerInvariant();


                    <div class="client-accordion @(totalAtraso > 0 ? "has-exp" : "")"
                         data-search="@search"
                         data-expeditado="@(totalAtraso > 0 ? "1" : "0")"
                         data-pendiente="@(totalPendiente > 0 ? "1" : "0")"
                         data-programado="@(totalProgramado > 0 ? "1" : "0")">
                        <button type="button" class="client-head js-client-toggle">
                            <div class="client-head-inner">
                                <div>
                                    <div class="client-name">@grupo.Key.Cliente</div>

                                    <div class="client-sub">
                                        <span>@grupo.Count() parte(s)</span>
                                        <span>·</span>
                                        <span>Día habitual: <strong>@diasTexto</strong></span>

                                        @if (totalAtraso > 0)
                                        {
                                            <span class="status status-exp">Expeditado</span>
                                        }
                                    </div>
                                </div>

                                <div class="client-kpi">
                                    <span>Semana</span>
                                    <strong>@totalSemana.ToString("N0")</strong>
                                </div>

                                <div class="client-kpi danger">
                                    <span>Atraso</span>
                                    <strong>@totalAtraso.ToString("N0")</strong>
                                </div>

                                <div class="client-kpi mobile-show">
                                    <span>Por atender</span>
                                    <strong>@totalAtender.ToString("N0")</strong>
                                </div>

                                <div class="client-kpi warning hide-medium">
                                    <span>Sin programar</span>
                                    <strong>@totalPendiente.ToString("N0")</strong>
                                </div>

                                <div class="client-kpi success hide-medium">
                                    <span>Enviado</span>
                                    <strong>@totalEnviado.ToString("N0")</strong>
                                </div>

                                <div class="chevron">⌄</div>
                            </div>
                        </button>

                        <div class="client-body">
                            <div class="client-toolbar">
                                <span><strong>@grupo.Key.Cliente</strong> · @grupo.Count() parte(s)</span>
                                <span>Programado: <strong>@totalProgramado.ToString("N0")</strong> · Sin programar: <strong>@totalPendiente.ToString("N0")</strong></span>
                            </div>


                            <div class="table-wrap">
                                <table class="parts">
                                    <thead>
                                        <tr>
                                            <th style="width:115px">Referencia</th>
                                            <th style="width:205px">Designación</th>
                                            <th style="width:72px">Semana</th>
                                            <th style="width:72px">Atraso</th>
                                            <th style="width:80px">Por atender</th>
                                            <th style="width:67px">Lun<br /><small>@Model.FechaInicio.ToString("dd/MM")</small></th>
                                            <th style="width:67px">Mar<br /><small>@Model.FechaInicio.AddDays(1).ToString("dd/MM")</small></th>
                                            <th style="width:67px">Mié<br /><small>@Model.FechaInicio.AddDays(2).ToString("dd/MM")</small></th>
                                            <th style="width:67px">Jue<br /><small>@Model.FechaInicio.AddDays(3).ToString("dd/MM")</small></th>
                                            <th style="width:67px">Vie<br /><small>@Model.FechaInicio.AddDays(4).ToString("dd/MM")</small></th>
                                            <th style="width:67px">Sáb<br /><small>@Model.FechaInicio.AddDays(5).ToString("dd/MM")</small></th>
                                            <th style="width:95px">Programado</th>
                                            <th style="width:85px">Enviado</th>
                                            <th style="width:145px">Ubicación</th>
                                            <th style="width:90px">Acción</th>
                                        </tr>
                                    </thead>

                                    <tbody>
                                        @foreach (var fila in grupo.OrderByDescending(x => x.EsExpeditado).ThenBy(x => x.Referencia))
                                        {
                                            var porcentajeProgramado = fila.PorcentajeProgramado.ToString("0.##", CultureInfo.InvariantCulture) + "%";
                                            var porcentajeEnviado = fila.PorcentajeEnviado.ToString("0.##", CultureInfo.InvariantCulture) + "%";

                                            var diasJson = JsonSerializer.Serialize(
                                            fila.DiasHabituales
                                            .Select(x => x.DiaSemana)
                                            .Distinct()
                                            .OrderBy(x => x)
                                            .ToList());
                                            var programacionesEditables = fila.Programaciones
                                            .Where(x => x.Activo && !string.Equals(x.Estatus, "Cancelada", StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase) && x.PendienteGenerar > 0)
                                            .OrderBy(x => x.FechaProgramadaCarga)
                                            .ThenBy(x => x.ListaCargaProgramacionID)
                                            .Select(x => new
                                            {
                                                fecha = x.FechaProgramadaCarga.ToString("yyyy-MM-dd"),
                                                cantidad = x.PendienteGenerar,
                                                observaciones = x.Observaciones ?? string.Empty
                                            })
                                            .ToList();
                                            var programacionesJson = JsonSerializer.Serialize(programacionesEditables);
                                            var totalGenerado = fila.TotalGeneradoEmbarques;
                                            var totalEditable = Math.Max(0, fila.TotalPorAtender - totalGenerado);
                                            var puedeAjustar = Model.SemanaAbierta && totalEditable > 0 && (fila.TotalSinProgramar > 0 || fila.TotalPendienteGenerar > 0);

                                            var fechas = new[]
                                            {
                                                                        Model.FechaInicio.Date,
                                                                        Model.FechaInicio.AddDays(1).Date,
                                                                        Model.FechaInicio.AddDays(2).Date,
                                                                        Model.FechaInicio.AddDays(3).Date,
                                                                        Model.FechaInicio.AddDays(4).Date,
                                                                        Model.FechaInicio.AddDays(5).Date
                                                                        };

                                            var valores = new[]
                                            {
                                                                        fila.Lunes,
                                                                        fila.Martes,
                                                                        fila.Miercoles,
                                                                        fila.Jueves,
                                                                        fila.Viernes,
                                                                        fila.Sabado
                                                                        };

                                            var requeridos = new[]
                                            {
                                                                        fila.RequeridoLunes,
                                                                        fila.RequeridoMartes,
                                                                        fila.RequeridoMiercoles,
                                                                        fila.RequeridoJueves,
                                                                        fila.RequeridoViernes,
                                                                        fila.RequeridoSabado
                                                                        };

                                            <tr class="@(fila.EsExpeditado ? "part-exp" : "")">
                                                <td class="left">
                                                    <span class="reference">@fila.Referencia</span>
                                                </td>

                                                <td class="left">
                                                    <span class="designation" title="@fila.Designacion">@fila.Designacion</span>
                                                </td>

                                                <td>
                                                    <span class="demand-number">@fila.TotalSemana.ToString("N0")</span>
                                                </td>

                                                <td>
                                                    <span class="demand-number @(fila.Atraso > 0 ? "late" : "")">
                                                        @(fila.Atraso > 0 ? fila.Atraso.ToString("N0") : "-")
                                                    </span>
                                                </td>

                                                <td>
                                                    <span class="demand-number">@fila.TotalPorAtender.ToString("N0")</span>

                                                    @if (fila.TotalSinProgramar > 0)
                                                    {
                                                        <span class="track-sub warn">
                                                            Sin fecha @fila.TotalSinProgramar.ToString("N0")
                                                        </span>
                                                    }
                                                </td>

                                                @for (var i = 0; i < 6; i++)
                                                {
                                                    <td class="@(fila.EsDiaHabitual(fechas[i]) ? "habitual" : "")">
                                                        <div class="day-cell">
                                                            @if (valores[i] > 0)
                                                            {
                                                                <span class="day-value">@valores[i].ToString("N0")</span>
                                                                <span class="day-programmed-label">Programado</span>
                                                                @if (requeridos[i] > 0)
                                                                {
                                                                    <span class="day-required">Pendiente sugerido @requeridos[i].ToString("N0")</span>
                                                                }
                                                            }
                                                            else if (requeridos[i] > 0)
                                                            {
                                                                <span class="day-value suggested">@requeridos[i].ToString("N0")</span>
                                                                <span class="day-required">Pendiente sugerido</span>
                                                            }
                                                            else
                                                            {
                                                                <span class="day-value empty">-</span>
                                                            }
                                                        </div>
                                                    </td>
                                                }

                                                <td>
                                                    <span class="track-main">@fila.TotalProgramado.ToString("N0")</span>

                                                    <div class="progress">
                                                        <span style="width:@porcentajeProgramado"></span>
                                                    </div>

                                                    @if (fila.TotalProgramado > 0)
                                                    {
                                                        <span class="track-sub ok">Programado</span>
                                                    }
                                                </td>

                                                <td>
                                                    <span class="track-main" style="color:var(--ok)">
                                                        @fila.TotalEnviado.ToString("N0")
                                                    </span>

                                                    <div class="progress success">
                                                        <span style="width:@porcentajeEnviado"></span>
                                                    </div>
                                                </td>

                                                <td>
                                                    <div class="location">
                                                        <strong>@fila.UbicacionTexto</strong>

                                                        @if (fila.TieneMaterialLocalizado)
                                                        {
                                                            <small>
                                                                @if (fila.PiezasAlmacen > 0)
                                                                {
                                                                    <span>ALM @fila.PiezasAlmacen.ToString("N0")</span>
                                                                }

                                                                @if (fila.PiezasProduccion > 0)
                                                                {
                                                                    <span> · PROD @fila.PiezasProduccion.ToString("N0")</span>
                                                                }

                                                                @if (fila.PiezasGP12 > 0)
                                                                {
                                                                    <span> · GP12 @fila.PiezasGP12.ToString("N0")</span>
                                                                }
                                                            </small>
                                                        }
                                                    </div>
                                                </td>

                                                <td>
                                                    @if (puedeAjustar)
                                                    {
                                                        <button type="button"
                                                                class="btn btn-sm btn-primary js-programar"
                                                                data-cliente-id="@fila.ClienteID"
                                                                data-parte-id="@fila.ParteID"
                                                                data-cliente="@fila.Cliente"
                                                                data-referencia="@fila.Referencia"
                                                                data-designacion="@fila.Designacion"
                                                                data-editable="@totalEditable"
                                                                data-generado="@totalGenerado"
                                                                data-sin-programar="@fila.TotalSinProgramar"
                                                                data-semana-inicio="@Model.FechaInicio.ToString("yyyy-MM-dd")"
                                                                data-semana-fin="@Model.FechaInicio.AddDays(5).ToString("yyyy-MM-dd")"
                                                                data-dias='@diasJson'
                                                                data-programaciones='@programacionesJson'>
                                                            @(fila.TotalProgramado > 0 ? "Ajustar" : "Programar")
                                                        </button>
                                                    }
                                                    else if (fila.TotalProgramado > 0)
                                                    {
                                                        <span class="status status-programmed">Programado</span>
                                                    }
                                                    else
                                                    {
                                                        <span class="track-sub ok">Completo</span>
                                                    }
                                                </td>
                                            </tr>
                                        }
                                    </tbody>
                                </table>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                }

                <div id="sinResultados" class="no-results">
                    No hay clientes que coincidan con los filtros.
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    @if (Model.ListaCargaSemanaID.HasValue)
    {
        <div id="programarBackdrop" class="dialog-backdrop" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="dialog" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="prTitulo">
                <form method="post" asp-controller="LogisticaListaCarga" asp-action="GuardarProgramacion" id="formProgramacion">
                    @Html.AntiForgeryToken()
                    <input type="hidden" name="ListaCargaSemanaID" value="@Model.ListaCargaSemanaID" />
                    <input type="hidden" name="ClienteID" id="prClienteID" />
                    <input type="hidden" name="ParteID" id="prParteID" />
                    <input type="hidden" name="Anio" value="@Model.Anio" />
                    <input type="hidden" name="NumeroSemana" value="@Model.NumeroSemana" />
                    <div class="dialog-head">
                        <div>
                            <h3 id="prTitulo">Programar día de carga</h3>
                            <small id="prSubtitulo"></small>
                        </div>
                        <button type="button" class="x js-cerrar" aria-label="Cerrar">×</button>
                    </div>
                    <div class="dialog-body">
                        <div class="planner-top">
                            <div class="planner-kpi">
                                <span>Saldo editable</span>
                                <strong id="prTotal">0</strong>
                            </div>
                            <div class="planner-kpi before">
                                <span>Programado antes</span>
                                <strong id="prOriginal">0</strong>
                            </div>
                            <div class="planner-kpi after">
                                <span>Programado al guardar</span>
                                <strong id="prCapturado">0</strong>
                            </div>
                            <div class="planner-kpi remaining" id="cardRestante">
                                <span>Quedará sin fecha</span>
                                <strong id="prRestante">0</strong>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="planner-context">
                            <span>Día habitual: <strong id="prHabitual">-</strong></span>
                            <span>Ya protegido en embarque: <strong id="prProtegido">0 PZA</strong></span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="live-location">
                            <div class="live-location-head">
                                <strong>● Ubicación actual del material</strong>
                                <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm" id="btnActualizarUbicacion">↻ Actualizar</button>
                            </div>
                            <div class="live-location-grid">
                                <div><span>Ubicación</span><strong id="liveUbicacion">Consultando...</strong></div>
                                <div><span>Almacén PT</span><strong id="liveAlmacen">-</strong></div>
                                <div><span>Producción</span><strong id="liveProduccion">-</strong></div>
                                <div><span>GP12</span><strong id="liveGP12">-</strong></div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="live-location-foot">Total localizado: <strong id="liveTotal">-</strong> PZA <span id="liveActualizado"></span></div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="planner-help">
                            <strong>Regla del ajuste:</strong> las cantidades que ya están programadas <strong>no se descuentan automáticamente</strong>. Agregar otra fecha utiliza únicamente el saldo que todavía está sin programar. Si quieres mover piezas de una fecha existente a otra, reduce tú misma la cantidad de la fecha original y después agrégala en la nueva fecha. Lo que ya generó embarque está protegido y no entra en este saldo editable.
                        </div>
                        <div id="mensajePlan" class="planner-message info"></div>
                        <div class="planner-actions">
                            <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm" id="btnOtraFecha">+ Agregar otra fecha</button>
                            <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-soft" id="btnRestablecer">Restablecer programación</button>
                        </div>
                        <div class="planner-list">
                            <div class="planner-list-head">
                                <div>Fecha de carga</div>
                                <div>Cantidad</div>
                                <div>Observaciones</div>
                                <div></div>
                            </div>
                            <div id="programacionFilas"></div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="rest-bar">
                            <div class="rest-head">
                                <span>Resultado del ajuste</span>
                                <strong id="prAvanceTexto">0 / 0 PZA</strong>
                            </div>
                            <div class="rest-track" id="prTrack"><span id="prTrackBar"></span></div>
                            <span class="rest-detail" id="prDetalleResultado">Sin cambios.</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="dialog-foot">
                        <div class="dialog-foot-summary" id="prFooterResumen"><strong>0 PZA</strong> programadas · 0 PZA sin fecha</div>
                        <div class="dialog-foot-actions">
